text = "The skeletal figure regards you with what might be curiosity, its violet eyes flickering with renewed interest as you offer your respectful greeting. 'Manners... it has been centuries since anyone showed me manners,' it rasps, and the oppressive magical pressure in the room eases slightly as it gestures for you to rise.

"
